WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.299
Life happens in color.

00:03.100 --> 00:04.200
A smile.

00:04.599 --> 00:05.799
A sunrise.

00:06.799 --> 00:08.800
A moment you never want to forget.

00:09.949 --> 00:12.333
Yet when was the last time

00:12.333 --> 00:16.500
you truly saw the colors of your own life?

00:17.566 --> 00:19.966
That's why we created Inkoo.

00:20.566 --> 00:23.766
With color E Ink and PercepTone®,

00:24.166 --> 00:26.566
our own image-processing engine,

00:26.966 --> 00:30.566
we bring photographs closer to the colors you remember.

00:31.933 --> 00:33.649
Your memories, calendar,

00:34.049 --> 00:36.883
to-dos, and weather come together.

00:37.149 --> 00:39.850
And with Inkoo’s image generation,

00:40.383 --> 00:43.483
what you imagine becomes what you see.

00:43.899 --> 00:45.416
Inkoo is more than a frame.

00:46.100 --> 00:48.399
It's a new way to see your life.

00:49.000 --> 00:50.799
Inkoo, by Dovery.

00:52.016 --> 00:53.416
See your life again.

00:53.416 --> 00:55.316
In its true colors.
